@startuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam TitleFontColor #1E293B
skinparam ArrowColor #2980B9
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #475569
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F2F9FF
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1E293B
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontStyle bold

title Sprint 4 - Historical Search & Target My IP Sequence Diagram

actor "Security Analyst" as Analyst
participant "History UI\n(HistoryPage.tsx)" as UI
participant "Express Server\n(server.js)" as Server
database "MongoDB Atlas\n(Database)" as DB

Analyst -> UI : Click "Target My IP" helper
activate UI

UI -> UI : Query public IP API (jsonip.com)
UI --> UI : Resolve client public IP address

UI -> Server : GET /api/history?ip=clientIp&page=1
activate Server

Server -> DB : Mongoose: find({s_ip: clientIp}) with pagination
activate DB
DB --> Server : Return BSON threat documents
deactivate DB

Server --> UI : Return JSON threat logs array
deactivate Server

UI -> UI : Render paginated threat data table rows

UI --> Analyst : Display target matches list
deactivate UI
@enduml
